{"name":"Elusive","hex":"#fed7cf","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"elusive","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Evading capture, comprehension or remembrance.","Difficult to make precise."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/elusive"}],"entries":[{"title":"Elusive","blocks":[{"text":"\"Elusive\" was the first single for British singer-songwriter Scott Matthews and was released on 18 September 2006. The single received much airplay from BBC Radio DJs Jo Whiley, Dermot O'Leary and Zane Lowe between 7 and 10 August. Lowe also played \"Elusive\" once each night as his chosen Single of the Week. Matthews also visited the station to perform \"Elusive\" and other songs from the album in May and August 2006. In May 2007, he won the Ivor Novello Award for \"Best Song Musically and Lyrically\" which saw \"Elusive\" beat strong competition from the likes of the Arctic Monkeys."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elusive"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"elusive":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/En-us-elusive-illusive.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/En-us-elusive-illusive.ogg/En-us-elusive-illusive.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Jjamesryan-elusive.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Jjamesryan-elusive.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Jjamesryan-elusive.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Jjamesryan-elusive.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Jjamesryan-elusive.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Little sparrow on a pink wall","image":"htt